---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing — N-Ops"
  description="N-Ops plans: free self-hosting, usage-based Managed Cloud, and Enterprise with SLAs."
  path="/pricing"
>
<section class="relative pt-[clamp(32px,5vw,72px)] pb-[clamp(40px,6vw,88px)]" aria-labelledby="pp-h"><div class="wrap"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[var(--gut)] gap-y-10 items-center">
<div class="col-span-6 max-bp2:col-span-12"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line-2 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.08em]"><i class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-mint"></i>N-Ops Managed Cloud</span>
<h1 id="pp-h" class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.6rem,5.6vw,5rem)] leading-[.98] tracking-[-.05em]">Rather not run it yourself? <span class="grad-t">We&rsquo;ve got you covered.</span></h1>
<p class="mt-6 max-w-[48ch] text-ink-2 text-[clamp(16px,1.3vw,18px)]">The full open-source platform, run by our team. Start free, pay only for what goes past the included projects and servers, and move up to enterprise SLAs when you need them.</p>
<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><a class="btn btn-mint" href="/contact">Talk to us</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#plans">Compare plans</a></div></div>
<div class="col-span-6 max-bp2:col-span-12 relative"><div class="rounded-[22px] border border-line-2 bg-surface p-5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-40px_rgba(11,17,24,.45)]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 pb-4 font-mono text-[11px] text-mute"><span class="flex gap-1"><i class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-2"></i><i class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-2"></i><i class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-2"></i></span>N-Ops Managed Cloud<span class="ml-auto rounded px-2 py-1 bg-mint text-ink-f text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[.1em] uppercase">Most popular</span></div><ul><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-line-2 first:border-t-0 py-3.5 text-[15px]"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="var(--color-mint)"/><path d="M6 10.4l2.6 2.6L14 7.6" stroke="#0B1118" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Hosted, patched and upgraded for you</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-line-2 first:border-t-0 py-3.5 text-[15px]"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="var(--color-mint)"/><path d="M6 10.4l2.6 2.6L14 7.6" stroke="#0B1118" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Unlimited users on paid plans</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-line-2 first:border-t-0 py-3.5 text-[15px]"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="var(--color-mint)"/><path d="M6 10.4l2.6 2.6L14 7.6" stroke="#0B1118" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>First 5 projects and 20 servers free</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-line-2 first:border-t-0 py-3.5 text-[15px]"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="var(--color-mint)"/><path d="M6 10.4l2.6 2.6L14 7.6" stroke="#0B1118" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Email support, priority support on Enterprise</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-line-2 first:border-t-0 py-3.5 text-[15px]"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="var(--color-mint)"/><path d="M6 10.4l2.6 2.6L14 7.6" stroke="#0B1118" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>99.9% uptime SLA on Enterprise</li></ul></div>
<div class="mt-3 ml-auto w-fit rounded-xl border border-line-2 bg-surface px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-mute"><b class="font-medium text-ink">Free tier</b> &middot; 1 user &middot; 5 projects &middot; 20 servers</div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="sec !pt-[clamp(16px,2.5vw,40px)]" id="plans" aria-labelledby="pi-h"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>Plans</p><h2 id="pi-h" class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1] tracking-[-.045em]">Pick how you run it.</h2><div class="rgrid mt-10"><div class="col-span-12 grid grid-cols-3 max-bp2:grid-cols-1 max-bp2:max-w-[520px] gap-[var(--gut)] items-stretch"><article class="plan relative flex flex-col rounded-[clamp(20px,2.2vw,30px)] p-[clamp(24px,2.4vw,34px)] border border-line-2 bg-surface"><div class="flex h-6 items-center justify-between"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-mute">Plan / 01</p><span class="text-mute"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l9-8 9 8M5 10v10h14V10"/></svg></span></div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(1.5rem,2vw,1.9rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-.03em]">Self-Hosted</h3><p class="mt-3 font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.05em] text-[clamp(2.6rem,4.4vw,4rem)]">$0<small class="ml-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-normal tracking-normal text-mute">/ forever</small></p><p class="mt-4 mb-6 min-h-[3.2em] text-[15px] text-mute">Every feature. Your servers, your rules.</p><ul><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Unlimited servers &amp; users</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Secrets, Docker, deploys, automation</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>SSO, RBAC &amp; audit log</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Community support</li></ul><div class="mt-auto"><a class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-line-2 px-5 py-3.5 font-medium transition-colors hover:border-ink" href="https://github.com/Neko-Nik-Org/N-Ops-Main-API" rel="noopener">Install now<span class="text-mute"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span></a></div></article><article class="plan relative flex flex-col rounded-[clamp(20px,2.2vw,30px)] p-[clamp(24px,2.4vw,34px)] border border-transparent [background:linear-gradient(var(--color-surface),var(--color-surface))_padding-box,var(--grad)_border-box]"><div class="flex h-6 items-center justify-between"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-mute">Plan / 02</p><span class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 bg-mint text-ink-f font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium leading-none tracking-[.1em] uppercase">Most popular</span></div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(1.5rem,2vw,1.9rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-.03em]">Managed Cloud</h3><p class="mt-3 font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.05em] text-[clamp(2.6rem,4.4vw,4rem)]">$0<small class="ml-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-normal tracking-normal text-mute">/ to start, then usage-based</small></p><p class="mt-4 mb-6 min-h-[3.2em] text-[15px] text-mute">First 5 projects and 20 servers included free. Pay only past that, at low, simple rates.</p><ul><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Everything in Self-Hosted</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Hosted, patched &amp; upgraded</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Unlimited users, always</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Email support</li></ul><div class="mt-auto"><a class="group mt-8 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-ink text-bg px-5 py-3.5 font-medium" href="/waitlist" rel="noopener">Try Managed Cloud<span class="grid place-items-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-mint text-ink-f"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span></a></div></article><article class="plan relative flex flex-col rounded-[clamp(20px,2.2vw,30px)] p-[clamp(24px,2.4vw,34px)] border border-line-2 bg-surface"><div class="flex h-6 items-center justify-between"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-mute">Plan / 03</p><span class="text-mute"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M10 21v-4h4v4M9 7h.01M15 7h.01M9 11h.01M15 11h.01"/></svg></span></div><h3 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(1.5rem,2vw,1.9rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-.03em]">Enterprise</h3><p class="mt-3 font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.05em] text-[clamp(2.6rem,4.4vw,4rem)]">Custom</p><p class="mt-4 mb-6 min-h-[3.2em] text-[15px] text-mute">Managed service with enterprise SLAs.</p><ul><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>99.9% uptime SLA</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Priority support &amp; a named engineer</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Guided onboarding</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-dashed border-line py-3 text-[15px] first:border-t"><svg class="shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg>Dedicated, isolated instance</li></ul><div class="mt-auto"><a class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-line-2 px-5 py-3.5 font-medium transition-colors hover:border-ink" href="/contact" rel="noopener">Contact sales<span class="text-mute"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span></a></div></article></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="in-h"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>What&rsquo;s included</p><h2 id="in-h" class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1] tracking-[-.045em]">Everything in N-Ops, without the upkeep.</h2>
<div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 max-bp2:grid-cols-1 gap-[var(--gut)]"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Fully managed platform</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">We host, patch, upgrade and monitor the N-Ops control plane for you.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Unlimited users</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Paid plans have unlimited users. The free tier is for a single user.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Usage-based billing</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">First 5 projects and 20 servers are included. Pay only for what goes past that.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Organisation limits</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Cap the number of users, projects, services, variables and files, and servers per organisation.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Real support</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Email support on Managed Cloud. Priority support, a named engineer and phone support where a real person answers on Enterprise.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">The same open-source product</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Managed N-Ops is the GNU GPL v3.0 platform you could also run yourself.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="py-[clamp(48px,7vw,104px)] text-center" aria-labelledby="st-h"><div class="wrap"><p class="text-[clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.8rem)] tracking-[-.02em]">Not a black box.</p><h2 id="st-h" class="mx-auto max-w-none mt-3 text-[clamp(2.6rem,7vw,6.4rem)] leading-[.95] tracking-[-.055em]"><span class="grad-t">Pay for what you use.</span><br>Nothing you don&rsquo;t.</h2></div></section>
<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="gs-h"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>Getting started</p><h2 id="gs-h" class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1] tracking-[-.045em]">From first call to first server.</h2>
<div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 max-bp2:grid-cols-1 gap-[var(--gut)]"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.14em] text-mint-ink">01</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Talk to us</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Tell us about your servers, teams and requirements.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.14em] text-mint-ink">02</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">We set up your workspace</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Your organisation, roles and security policies, ready to use.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.14em] text-mint-ink">03</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Connect your servers</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Install the agent on each Linux server and your fleet appears live.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec" id="waitlist" aria-labelledby="wl-h"><div class="wrap">
<div class="on-dark relative overflow-hidden rounded-[clamp(20px,2.2vw,30px)] bg-t-bg text-t-ink p-[clamp(28px,4vw,64px)]" data-wl-hide>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-[10%] -top-[40%] w-[60%] aspect-square rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(closest-side,rgba(138,124,255,.28),transparent)] motion-safe:animate-[wlGlow_6s_ease-in-out_infinite]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-[10%] -bottom-[50%] w-[55%] aspect-square rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(closest-side,rgba(76,242,192,.2),transparent)] motion-safe:animate-[wlGlow_7s_ease-in-out_infinite_1s]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[var(--gut)] gap-y-8 items-center">
    <div class="col-span-7 max-bp2:col-span-12">
      <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-t-mute"><span class="wl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Managed Cloud &middot; early access</p>
      <h2 id="wl-h" class="mt-5 max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.6vw,4.2rem)] leading-[.95] tracking-[-.05em]">Be first on <span class="grad-t">Managed Cloud.</span></h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[46ch] text-[#AEB9C6] text-[clamp(16px,1.3vw,18px)]">Tell us about your setup and we&rsquo;ll bring you in early. Your answers shape what we build first.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-5 max-bp2:col-span-12 flex flex-col items-start gap-5 bp2:pl-[var(--gut)] bp2:border-l bp2:border-[var(--color-t-line)]">
      <ul class="grid gap-3 text-[15px]">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="bar"></span>Takes under 2 minutes</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="bar"></span>Early access before public launch</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="bar"></span>No card, no commitment</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-mint group" href="/waitlist">Join the waitlist<svg class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="fq-h"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>FAQ</p><h2 id="fq-h" class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1] tracking-[-.045em]">About Managed Cloud</h2><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 max-bp2:grid-cols-1 gap-[var(--gut)]"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Is it a different product from the open-source version?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">No. It&rsquo;s the same GNU GPL v3.0 N-Ops, run and supported by our team.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">How much does it cost?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">The free tier covers one user, 5 projects and 20 servers. On a paid plan you get unlimited users and pay per extra project and per extra server. Enterprise pricing is custom.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Do my servers still run on my infrastructure?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">Yes. We run the control plane. Your servers stay where they are and connect through the agent.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-line-2 bg-surface p-6"><h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.02em]">Can I move to self-hosted later?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] text-mute leading-[1.55]">It&rsquo;s the same open-source product, so self-hosting is always an option. Talk to us about moving your setup.</p></div></div><p class="mt-8"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/faq">More questions</a></p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
